  "description": "*\"Would you like to be the princess of Asir Hart?\"*\n\nMia Hit, a girl from a country defeated in war, becomes the princess of war power Asir Hart at the suggestion of Princess Libel.\n\nPrincess Ribel, who suddenly left after leaving her as acting princess, and the Royal Honorary Knights, who continue to doubt Mia while helping her, are full of things that Mia cannot easily understand. The catastrophe that is spreading across the continent is finally coming to Asir Hart, and Mia faces a huge secret inside the palace.\n\n*\"Then, what is my destiny?\"*\n\n(Source: Kakao, translated)",
